8)Diff between PV and PVC
PV is the actual storage available in the cluster, while PVC is a request by a pod for that storage. 
PV is like the storage unit, and PVC is like the claim to use that storage.”
PV is created (manually or dynamically via StorageClass)
PVC is created requesting storage
Kubernetes binds PVC → PV
Pod mounts the PVC for storage
When PVC is deleted, depending on Reclaim Policy, PV is either:
Retained
Deleted
Recycled (deprecated)

