3. Worker Nodes Upgrade (Rolling Upgrade)
Workers are upgraded gradually to ensure workload availability.
Step	Action
Cordon Node	Prevent new pods from scheduling
Drain Node	Evict pods and reschedule to other workers
Upgrade OS & OpenShift components	Node reboot and update
Uncordon Node Bring node back to scheduling
oc adm cordon <node>
oc adm drain <node> --ignore-daemonsets --force --delete-emptydir-data
# Upgrade happens through Machine Config Operator (MCO)
oc adm uncordon <node>
