10) Can we automate the openshift cluster uograde?
Yes, OpenShift upgrades can be automated. The Cluster Version Operator handles control plane upgrades and the Machine Config Operator automatically upgrades workers in a rolling fashion.
For enterprise environments, we integrate GitOps or RHACM to schedule automated upgrades with pre/post validation.”

